# GMS ignores 2% of the enemy's defense per Freeze Stack, on frozen enemies
# only, with a chance that reaches 100% at max over four levels. The chance is
# dropped, like every roll that ends at certain here; what is left is GMS's 2% a
# stack, stepped evenly over this book's twenty levels. A full five stacks
# ignore GMS's 10%.
name: "Shatter"
description:
  "When attacking Frozen enemies, ignores a portion of their defenses for "
  "each stack."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_ICE_LIGHTNING_MAGE skill_order: 4 }
max_level: 20
base { ied_pct_per_freeze_stack: 0.001 }
per_level { ied_pct_per_freeze_stack: 0.001 }
